abstract: >
  CR-PH-CBF combines Port-Hamiltonian neural networks with adaptive 
  conformal prediction to achieve provably safe robot control under 
  severe dynamics uncertainty. The framework provides formal safety 
  guarantees while maintaining high task performance in uncertain 
  environments.
